worksuite-os (1.0.0~dev2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Drivers (#69): Debian's own APT sources are recognised (deb822 embedded
    Signed-By keys, *.debian.org mirrors, mirrors pinned to Debian's archive
    keyring, http/https duplicates, installation-disc entries); unsigned
    Debian lines get Debian's keyring; trusted=yes and missing Signed-By
    keyrings are refused by name. Settings › Drivers names the failed stage
    and the source, offers Try again, and asks for a restart only after a
    successful install that needs one.

